cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MapIt in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MapIt: a fast, convention-based object-to-object mapper for .NET"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "MapIt Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/agusumri/MapIt"
url: "https://github.com/agusumri/MapIt"
abstract: >-
  MapIt is an open-source (MIT) object-to-object mapper for .NET with a fluent
  configuration API, convention-based matching, flattening and unflattening,
  projection to IQueryable, validation, and a compile-time (AOT) source generator.
keywords:
  - object-mapper
  - mapping
  - dotnet
  - csharp
  - dto
  - projection
  - aot
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
